    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0da03867f7038129ede3dea1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便是“否”——也“想留下什么”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "846fc103225faaea856b22f21b3d91f165f4eaabf91aa390f9caa1093ff98038",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe95eb0b5e9fa78aab387ffd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在其他宇宙，这是这两人最后一次交手的比赛。\r\n而在这个宇宙，这场比赛又是否会是二人命运的\r\n终点呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb91742a6f93c64792c582c959a6d597da84102a2a548e81459b61f65a8c9559",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ee6ba0698e0ebea77122eec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且……虽说其他宇宙的新宇宙成功地完成了比\r\n赛，也不能保证不会发生任何意外。\r\n我决定，将二人的激斗守望至最后一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b58f03bbead6c0288b518cfef0ac9342a64b2012d1e16f2fb708b170bf7e6e4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a6434442a15e1b597943b27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
