    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32809f8533d54b660cb92bd2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真正的“GATE”是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9448b1ba2be7ab881f40271c85bc8eccc96a307e5317082b8140d5460c9f62d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e841ce107759e54934b8494f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他宇宙的新宇宙，并非是在这场比赛中遭遇了\r\n什么，而是在“比赛后到夏天结束为止”的这段\r\n时间里遭遇了极为严重的伤情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f7c8bd837d4b1da4303bb23667a0b2b858c9a01e8a30eb9a55f0978a8c3aa7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c8ef38a000fbc715693a1bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然这样的话，这『天皇赏（春）』就只是一道\r\n虚伪的关卡罢了。\r\n没有必要选择避战——也不应选择避战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d5bb61aded05e29186205922735c32cd58f362a514d8100cbdc3f8db9324e54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596443925e199634c6e6b53a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
