      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfd4bfb21ed5a8a4179a84c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71c0755735049a66105d1412",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尤妮同学……\r\n今天也请你多多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db357ffd91d3703e1af7ff74355ae983d664b928ff823ac0a7e3c5fc7fa1e23e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daee24823496328cda325a5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4a50ab6a0409b88743de1ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然去年的我只能一直追着你的背影，\r\n但今年……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "552b763c860f13818898ee0c06559fd88477949a5f5b15a5ee8466cf94240f27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c3a39bf43f8c7c27229594c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇賞（春）にむけて",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1d48585b620e66c0b1af62d5d31ef22b13830ad6b20f11fb02131d3b3f1b51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e4abf6f6916921c185af166",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我们跨越了“GATE”。\r\n在夏季结束之后，我终于对此事有了些许实感。\r\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4a0ac67d3e49eb1d3f27090f1554a69325aa581489633033ea4ce6ada74990",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4d1e8fa8d605b2c8a0b8c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……必须要在这『天皇赏（春）』迈出第一步，\r\n才能真正确信我们已经成功。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15dd99fd9801830d9baded9cb9ac1c233bbfeaa6a75686e3df1ba5d7b8c2e38e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f1d939e5d987f02f2a917f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彷徨之旅业已终结。紧随而来的——是新章开幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b23ad3ef6094bb75dec820449d14a1a177103dfd07ec648ac348c16d94d5345",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c66f40016142b8a5798d328",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从现在开始，\r\n新宇宙便要在崭新的航路上启航。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e033bc20edeb1878debd6a303975d270b830e35f326347901f908adb237fd2e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
