      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓“故事”，便是激动人心、令人奋起，\r\n将读者心中“渴求着改变”的自己唤醒的存在！\r\n所以——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dec56e1d44f9261b7777e66b866af1dd4e90775e25cf98f8efb2bb1b93232dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105208.json",
      "json_path": [
