      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "重获新生的宇宙少女。终迎觉醒的英雄。\r\n这是——无人曾见证的，“第二章”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7567c883cd7886ca595c5eabfb11b40e7fc98af6026ad25f715aa6ab5725eb83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
